# Large run-time dumps (wav/pt/csv, Tracy CSVs, watcher logs) live here and are never committed.
generated/
# The repo-level .gitignore drops *.csv / *.log; keep the small evidence files the work log cites.
!doc/depth_decoder/tracy/*/perf_report.csv
!doc/depth_decoder/triage/trace_probe.log
# Stage 03 keeps its two Tracy raw ops dumps (ops.csv.gz, 0.5 MB) and stacked charts tracked: the work log's device-time
# figures are derived from them and cite them. Later stages commit only the report txt/csv/summary (rules below).
# Stage 05: the diffusers scheduler step triples (0.5 MB) are test inputs and travel with the tests.
!doc/flow_dit/pcc/scheduler_triples.pt
!doc/flow_dit/tracy/*/perf_report.csv
# Stage 05 Tracy raw ops dump and stacked chart are local-only (the report txt/csv/summary are committed).
doc/flow_dit/tracy/*/ops.csv.gz
doc/flow_dit/tracy/*/*.png
doc/flow_dit/tracy/*/*.console.log
# Stage 07 Tracy runs: raw ops dumps, pytest / run logs and console logs are local-only; the report txt/csv/summary are committed.
doc/optimize/tracy/*/ops.csv.gz
doc/optimize/tracy/*/*.log
!doc/optimize/tracy/*/perf_report.csv
